<title>INDIA: India Jardine rates Indian Hotels to buy.</title>
<headline>India Jardine rates Indian Hotels to buy.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jardine Fleming India Broking said on Thursday it upgraded Indian Hotels to a &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; on revised forecasts.</p>
</text>
